#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:3 3a4d07c3c87f40068a4c019259094a0d
msgid "Work with the matrix and field containers that extend GWpy's series types."
msgstr "GWpy の系列型を拡張する行列・場コンテナを扱います。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:9 189709754021450f9dfa8f172a0cc896
msgid "FrequencySeriesMatrix: Matrix Basics"
msgstr "FrequencySeriesMatrix: 行列処理の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:13 526772f5d6364da3893e3b4f1ec32754
msgid ""
"A 3D container (row x col x freq) for batches of `FrequencySeries` with "
"frequency-domain-aware indexing."
msgstr "`FrequencySeries` をまとめて扱う3次元コンテナ（行 x 列 x 周波数）。周波数領域を意識したインデクシングに対応します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:16 1f97e1a1fbca4b32acb7c63b1e029315
msgid "SpectrogramMatrix: Matrix Basics"
msgstr "SpectrogramMatrix: 行列処理の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:20 01ace87613c34f1188b19ed1fb0173b6
msgid ""
"Handle multiple `Spectrogram` objects as a single 3D (batch, time, "
"frequency) container."
msgstr "複数の `Spectrogram` オブジェクトを1つの3次元（バッチ、時刻、周波数）コンテナとして扱います。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:23 43a4781253ce4ea5ad3e323ddc1571ff
msgid "Field API: ScalarField Basics"
msgstr "Field API: ScalarField の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:27 429ef8ae779e43adbf3d4dcab8caf27a
msgid ""
"Basic usage of `ScalarField` for 4D (time + 3D space) data, including "
"indexing and metadata handling."
msgstr "時間＋3次元空間の4次元データを扱う `ScalarField` の基本的な使い方（インデクシングとメタデータの扱いを含む）。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:30 1dc00cf58d704c02a3fab0e4c05819f0
msgid "Field API: Advanced Analysis Workflow"
msgstr "Field API: 高度解析ワークフロー"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:34 0786b24fe4e847719875f38b992b21df
msgid ""
"A full analysis workflow built on `ScalarField`, going beyond the basics "
"into applied field processing."
msgstr "`ScalarField` を使った一連の解析ワークフロー。基本を超えて実践的な場のデータ処理に踏み込みます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:37 34c7a6a1037a4bda86a58eb8ac7fcdf5
msgid "Scalar Field Slicing Guide (Why 4D is Preserved)"
msgstr "スカラー場のスライス操作ガイド（なぜ 4 次元が保たれるのか）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:41 a1cecdf5286a4fa59327e6249a24f214
msgid ""
"Why `ScalarField` indexing always keeps 4 dimensions instead of "
"collapsing like NumPy, and when `squeeze()` is safe."
msgstr "`ScalarField` のインデクシングが NumPy のように次元を落とさず常に 4 次元を保つ理由と、`squeeze()` が安全な場面。"

